<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abitibi-Price upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abitibi-Price upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had upgraded its rating for Canada's Abitibi-Price Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the newsprint company opened up 3/4 to 17-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
